The cache eviction and set logic is duplicated in two branches of `getBankName` (lines 599-602 and 610-613). Both branches perform the identical sequence: check cache size, clear if needed, set the entry, and return. This can be consolidated into a single path by computing `result` in both branches and then caching once at the end.

